<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dear&nbsp;</font><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.Account}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;<b>{!Case.PMC_SS_Location__c}&nbsp;</b></font><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">has reported a low stock or no stock of&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.Product}</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;. To prevent immediate inconvenience&nbsp;</span></font></span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">to your shipping plans we wish to advise the following orders identified.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Customer PO number</font></li><li><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Mosaic order number</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We apologize for the impact to your business. As we work on</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">replenishment, we will update you with&nbsp;</font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">product ETA immediately so you can resume pick- up. Please reach out to your Customer</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Service&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Representative for further questions.</span></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.OwnerFullName}</b></font></div></div></div>]]></td>
